  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can tap into the powers of akasha to focus your martial abiltiies</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1, ability to initiate maneuvers.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a swift action, you may take essence burn equal to the highest maneuver recovered to recover maneuvers equal to your initiation modifier, you may do so a number of times per day equal to your veilweaving modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
